=e151]:\n          - generic [ref=e153]: $美国国债1-3年ETF-iShares(SHY)$\n          - generic [ref=e154]:\n            - generic [ref=e155]:\n              - link \"\" [ref=e157] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e158]: \n              - link \"\" [ref=e159] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: javascript:;\n                - generic [ref=e160]: \n              - link \"\" [ref=e161] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e162]: \n              - link \"\" [ref=e163] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e164]: \n              - link \"\" [ref=e165] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: \"\"\n                - generic [ref=e166]: \n              - link [ref=e168] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: \"\"\n                - img [ref=e169]\n              - link \" 长文\" [ref=e171] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: https://mp.xueqiu.com/write/?position=pc_stock_post\n                - generic [ref=e172]: \n                - text: 长文\n            - link \"发布\" [ref=e174]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n      - generic [ref=e175]:\n        - generic [ref=e176]:\n          - link \"全部\" [ref=e177] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"\"\n          - link \"讨论\" [ref=e178] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"\"\n          - link \"交易\" [ref=e179] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"\"\n          - link \"资讯\" [ref=e180] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"\"\n          - link \"公告\" [ref=e181] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"\"\n        - generic [ref=e182]:\n          - generic [ref=e184]:\n            - link \"新帖\" [ref=e185] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n            - link \"热帖\" [ref=e186] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: \"\"\n          - generic [ref=e188]:\n            - textbox \"搜索该股票相关信息\" [ref=e189]\n            - generic [ref=e190]: \n        - generic [ref=e191]:\n          - article [ref=e192]:\n            - link [ref=e193] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /Ko_Cheung\n              - img [ref=e194]\n            - generic [ref=e195]:\n              - generic [ref=e197]:\n                - link \"高翔Ko_Cheung\" [ref=e198] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /Ko_Cheung\n                - link \"02-18 22:15· 来自雪球\" [ref=e199] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /2241875984/376427903\n              - generic [ref=e203]:\n                - text: 美联储戴利表示，到中性利率之前，美联储大约还有75个基点的空间；需要降低通胀；除了医疗和教育，美国经济中大部分行业都面临失业，需要确保劳动力市场的脆弱性不会演变为实质性疲软。\n                - link \"$3-7年国债指数ETF-iShares(IEI)$\" [ref=e204] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/IEI\n                - link \"$美国国债1-3年ETF-iShares(SHY)$\" [ref=e205] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/SHY\n                - link \"$美国短期国债指数ETF-iShares(SHV)$\" [ref=e206] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/SHV\n              - generic [ref=e207]:\n                - link \" 转发\" [ref=e208] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e209]: \n                  - generic [ref=e210]: 转发\n                - link \" 讨论\" [ref=e211] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e212]: \n                  - generic [ref=e213]: 讨论\n                - link \" 赞\" [ref=e214] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e215]: \n                  - generic [ref=e216]: 赞\n                - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e217] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e218]: \n                  - generic [ref=e219]: 收藏\n          - article [ref=e220]:\n            - link [ref=e221] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /7528829663\n              - img [ref=e222]\n            - generic [ref=e223]:\n              - generic [ref=e225]:\n                - link \"且涨海外投\" [ref=e226] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /7528829663\n                - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e227]\n                - link \"2025-08-22 11:29· 来自雪球\" [ref=e228] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /7528829663/348393709\n              - generic [ref=e230] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - heading \"专栏丨 立足降息，但依然只做短久期美债\" [level=3] [ref=e231]:\n                  - strong [ref=e232]: 专栏丨\n                  - text: 立足降息，但依然只做短久期美债\n                - generic [ref=e234]:\n                  - text: 前几天写文章的时候，提到美联储在9月份降息的概率是比较高的，并且也针对美联储接下来可能降息，会产生的一些交易的机会，做了提示。\n                  - text: 但这两天美联储的各种官员的表态相对是偏鹰的，这个时候就要看周五的杰克逊霍尔年会会有什么新的表态。\n                  - text: 最近这几天又有人问，既然美联储开始有降息的预...\n                - img [ref=e237]\n              - generic [ref=e238]:\n                - link \" 转发\" [ref=e239] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e240]: \n                  - generic [ref=e241]: 转发\n                - link \" 讨论\" [ref=e242] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e243]: \n                  - generic [ref=e244]: 讨论\n                - link \" 1\" [ref=e245] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e246]: \n                  - generic [ref=e247]: \"1\"\n                - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e248] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e249]: \n                  - generic [ref=e250]: 收藏\n          - article [ref=e251]:\n            - link [ref=e252] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /shiyutang\n              - img [ref=e253]\n            - generic [ref=e254]:\n              - generic [ref=e256]:\n                - link \"汤诗语\" [ref=e257] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /shiyutang\n                - img \"荣誉认证\" [ref=e258]\n                - img \"身份认证\" [ref=e259]\n                - link \"修改于2025-07-29 17:51· 来自雪球\" [ref=e260] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /5519392453/344654860\n              - generic [ref=e261]:\n                - generic [ref=e263]:\n                  - generic [ref=e264]:\n                    - text: 回复\n                    - link \"@逆天而行16\" [ref=e265] [cursor=pointer]:\n                      - /url: https://xueqiu.com/n/逆天而行16\n                    - text: \": 易方达有个中短期美元债的基金，但人民币份额每天好像是只限申购1000元，美元现汇份额倒是可以每天申购100万美元。你可以考虑到银行换汇（注意是换美元现汇，不是现钞）后再申购基金，还得注意你的银行是否支持申购美元的公募基金，好多银行都不支持。我看了下它最近三年的表现跟...\"\n                  - link \"展开\" [ref=e266] [cursor=pointer]:\n                    - /url: \"\"\n                - blockquote [ref=e267] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - link \"@metalslime ：\" [ref=e269]:\n                    - /url: /2292705444\n                    - generic [ref=e270]: \"@metalslime\"\n                    - generic [ref=e271]: ：\n                  - generic [ref=e274]:\n                    - text: 早上听了个股债性价比反转的电话会。\n                    - text: 基本解答了我周围不少还在薅国债的人收益率比股票这边的主流资金收益率拉开差距的疑问了。\n                    - text: 10pe业绩下滑10%以内，就是比25pe业绩不增长的资产好。而且ppi预期企稳后业绩从下滑转正，还会爆杀国债。\n                  - generic [ref=e275]:\n                    - text: 2025-07-29 09:45 · 转发 13\n                    - link \"· 讨论 265\" [ref=e276]:\n                      - /url: /2292705444/344546423#comment\n                    - text: · 赞 159\n              - generic [ref=e277]:\n                - link \" 2\" [ref=e278] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e279]: \n                  - generic [ref=e280]: \"2\"\n                - link \" 22\" [ref=e281] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e282]: \n                  - generic [ref=e283]: \"22\"\n                - link \" 19\" [ref=e284] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e285]: \n                  - generic [ref=e286]: \"19\"\n                - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e287] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e288]: \n                  - generic [ref=e289]: 收藏\n          - article [ref=e290]:\n            - link [ref=e291] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /2786120175\n              - img [ref=e292]\n            - generic [ref=e293]:\n              - generic [ref=e295]:\n                - link \"鹿月笙\" [ref=e296] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /2786120175\n                - link \"2025-05-25 20:15· 来自iPhone\" [ref=e297] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /2786120175/336323579\n              - generic [ref=e301]:\n                - link \"$美国国债1-3年ETF-iShares(SHY)$\" [ref=e302] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: https://xueqiu.com/S/SHY\n                - text: 长期美债价格下降导致收益率超过票面利息收入 至于短期美债的无风险利率还是坚挺 现在美股这个环境不上不下的 甚至有点畸形 历史而言 长期债券利率越低越能孕育牛市 内地长期国债就不一样了 收益率还在底部挣扎 从这点预测 内地确实可能再次迎来一次波澜壮阔的行\n              - generic [ref=e303]:\n                - link \" 转发\" [ref=e304] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e305]: \n                  - generic [ref=e306]: 转发\n                - link \" 1\" [ref=e307] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e308]: \n                  - generic [ref=e309]: \"1\"\n                - link \" 1\" [ref=e310] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e311]: \n                  - generic [ref=e312]: \"1\"\n                - link \" 收藏\" [ref=e313] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"\"\n                  - generic [ref=e314]: \n                  - generic [ref=e315]: 收藏\n          - article [ref=e316]:\n            - link [ref=e317] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - /url: /7698249065\n              - img [ref=e318]\n            - generic [ref=e319]:\n              - generic [ref=e321]:\n                - link \"天道轮回实盘\" [ref=e322] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  