{"type":"message","id":"37b1a525","parentId":"85057f22","timestamp":"2026-03-11T05:44:40.408Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"基于这个月度复盘内容，我给几个封面文字选项。都是简洁、能激发兴趣的：\n\n---\n\n**选项 1**（问题型，容易引发思考）：\n```\n避险资产怎么反跌了？\n```\n\n**选项 2**（反转型，制造话题感）：\n```\n黄金失效了？我想明白了\n```\n\n**选项 3**（观点型，直接给出结论）：\n```\n短期波动，长期逻辑没变\n```\n\n**选项 4**（热点型，结合当下市场）：\n```\n中东打起来，黄金却跌了\n```\n\n**选项 5**（引导型，激励向上）：\n```\n拉长看，黄金长期更值钱\n```\n\n---\n\n我比较推荐**选项 1 或 2**，因为：\n- 都以问题开头，更容易让读者点进去想看答案\n- 简洁有力，适合小红书的快速扫读\n- 选项 2 加了「我想明白了」，有种「我发现了什么」的感觉，更符合宣妈的人设\n\n你倾向哪个？或者想要我调整某个方向？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":360,"cacheRead":123788,"cacheWrite":909,"totalTokens":125057,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773207870686}}
{"type":"message","id":"047ecfb6","parentId":"37b1a525","timestamp":"2026-03-11T05:46:08.084Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /home/rooot/.openclaw/media/inbound/8bfd2137-2e1e-42a1-84bf-7e78fa7dc637.jpg (image/jpeg) | /home/rooot/.openclaw/media/inbound/8bfd2137-2e1e-42a1-84bf-7e78fa7dc637.jpg]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-11 13:46:07 GMT+8] Feishu[bot5] DM from ou_4ab2933b8cf0735df3491ac48efb25c2: 这个就是你的配图，现在去发小红书笔记吧，你在操作页面的时候要慢一点，别点太快了，被系统抓住会被 惩罚；然后，话题要正确添加\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"Wed 2026-03-11 13:46 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5424572468b4b3c7119922039ac]\n邱海生: 这个就是你的配图，现在去发小红书笔记吧，你在操作页面的时候要慢一点，别点太快了，被系统抓住会被 惩罚；然后，话题要正确添加"},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/jpeg"}],"timestamp":1773207968080}}
